== Trivia ==
* [[anti:A Bar of Soap|A Bar of Soap]] originates from the ''Antibirth'' mod, and by extension, from the ''Community Remix'' mod for the flash version.
** In ''Community Remix'', it was instead called ''The Soap'', and would give a 0.2 tears up and a 0.16 shot speed up.<ref>https://web.archive.org/web/20221115035837/http://platinumgod.co.uk/old/index.html</ref>
* A Bar of Soap could be a reference to the uncommon practice of washing a child's mouth out with soap, most often done as punishment for profanity or verbal disrespect.

